{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792160/extras/68e28ccb1842230af0014afa66e8b7be.avif?t=1766950015\" width=257 height=351 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who This Game is For</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of adventure, mystery, and comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792160/extras/c69806829ea72ecc62408dfb7e0b1ee0.webp?t=1766950015\" width=595 height=56 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crawl</strong>, <strong>jump</strong>, and <strong>roll</strong> your way through the jungle while <strong>solving ancient puzzles</strong> and <strong>battling advanced forestry bots</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your moves strategically, because you need to manage your <strong>stamina</strong>. Every movement (<strong>crawling, jumping, inflating</strong>) uses some of your stamina, but it recharges with time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your<strong>\u00a0bot</strong> assistant can <strong>launch</strong> you through the air and water or <strong>boost</strong> you on the ground, so <strong>alternate</strong> between using it and your own movement abilities to find the most efficient path forward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take matters into your own claws </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1792160/extras/c69806829ea72ecc62408dfb7e0b1ee0.webp?t=1766950015\" width=595 height=56 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>After having underwent experimental genetic modification, a sloth gains sudde